00:17:28.681 --> 00:17:30.617
I guess I'm a very neat...

00:17:30.717 --> 00:17:31.584
<i>Monster.</i>

00:17:31.718 --> 00:17:32.585
...person.

00:17:32.685 --> 00:17:33.720
"Neat" I understand,

00:17:33.853 --> 00:17:36.523
