00:21:02.061 --> 00:21:04.230
'Cause God knows how many
Little League games there are.

00:21:04.331 --> 00:21:05.931
The Mets play at seven.

00:21:05.932 --> 00:21:08.266
Mm. I did not know
you were a fan of baseball.

00:21:08.267 --> 00:21:10.303
