00:22:06.325 --> 00:22:07.860
[sighs]

00:22:07.994 --> 00:22:09.829
<i>Fucking tiny print.</i>

00:22:09.929 --> 00:22:12.765
<i>I got to increase my font size.</i>

00:22:13.633 --> 00:22:16.334
<i>Tonight, a grisly discovery
in the woods.</i>

00:22:16.335 --> 00:22:19.338
<i>A female hiker was killed today
in Worlds End State Park</i>

00:22:19.439 --> 00:22:20.707
<i>just outside of Forksville.</i>

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:22.542
<i>The victim has not yet
been identified,</i>

00:22:22.675 --> 00:22:24.176
<i>but authorities believe
this is another</i>

00:22:24.276 --> 00:22:25.512
<i>in a string of killings</i>

00:22:25.612 --> 00:22:27.680
<i>by the serial killer
called Rapunzel,</i>

00:22:27.814 --> 00:22:30.181
<i>given his moniker
for his grim signature,</i>

00:22:30.182 --> 00:22:32.485
<i>cutting off the victims'
ponytails.</i>

00:22:32.585 --> 00:22:34.186
Hey, old friend.

00:22:34.854 --> 00:22:37.356
I've got a real treat
for you guys.

00:22:37.457 --> 00:22:38.525
[crying]

00:22:38.625 --> 00:22:40.226
Take care of yourself.
Okay, pal?

00:22:40.326 --> 00:22:42.027
[reporter] <i>The last four
Rapunzel killings have also</i>

00:22:42.028 --> 00:22:43.895
<i>occurred at state parks
across the Midwest</i>

00:22:43.896 --> 00:22:45.197
<i>and Eastern Seaboard.</i>

00:22:45.331 --> 00:22:46.966
<i>Law enforcement
is warning the public</i>

00:22:47.066 --> 00:22:49.802
<i>to watch out for
a single male traveling alone.</i>

00:22:49.902 --> 00:22:51.704
<i>Possibly a long-haul trucker,
as all</i>

00:22:51.804 --> 00:22:53.573
<i>the other murder locations
seem to be following</i>

00:22:53.673 --> 00:22:55.374
<i>trucking routes
across the country.</i>

00:22:55.475 --> 00:22:57.043
You wish, man.

00:22:58.978 --> 00:23:01.748
<i>Near every state park where
they found a Rapunzel victim,</i>

00:23:01.848 --> 00:23:04.584
<i>there have been
several campgrounds.</i>

00:23:04.684 --> 00:23:06.753
<i>I started to wonder.</i>

00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:08.555
<i>Last year,
after a victim was found</i>

00:23:08.688 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>in Hawks Nest State Park
in West Virginia,</i>

00:23:11.691 --> 00:23:14.594
<i>I went to a nearby KOA
and confirmed that Al Walker</i>

00:23:14.727 --> 00:23:16.394
<i>and his family had been there.</i>

00:23:16.395 --> 00:23:18.631
<i>I just missed him.</i>

00:23:20.433 --> 00:23:23.470
<i>Since Prater's death,
Al has been on an extended</i>

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:26.773
<i>family vacation
across the country.</i>

00:23:26.873 --> 00:23:29.008
<i>Well, a working vacation.</i>

00:23:29.108 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>Time for my hobby.</i>

00:23:30.743 --> 00:23:32.378
[Harry]
Hold on, Dex.

00:23:32.479 --> 00:23:34.847
You've got Harrison's police
academy graduation coming up.

00:23:34.947 --> 00:23:36.849
