is only a few hours away.

00:23:36.949 --> 00:23:39.886
I can be there and back
and still show up for Harrison.

00:23:39.986 --> 00:23:41.688
What if you don't
make it back in time?

00:23:41.788 --> 00:23:44.456
What if Al kills or injures you?

00:23:44.457 --> 00:23:46.058
You don't have
a plan in place, son.

00:23:46.158 --> 00:23:48.294
You don't know the lay
of the land in Pennsylvania.

00:23:48.394 --> 00:23:50.997
What's with all the what-ifs?

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:52.799
I got this.

00:23:53.633 --> 00:23:54.901
What's the rush?

00:23:55.001 --> 00:23:57.269
No one's even looking
for a guy like him.

00:23:58.070 --> 00:23:59.505
Almost no one.

00:23:59.506 --> 00:24:01.841
And the rush is to keep him
from killing again.

00:24:01.941 --> 00:24:03.976
<i>♪ Back into my old ways ♪</i>

00:24:04.076 --> 00:24:05.978
<i>♪ Again ♪</i>

00:24:07.279 --> 00:24:08.581
[sighs]

00:24:08.681 --> 00:24:10.516
- <i>♪ Ways again ♪</i>
- [grunting softly]

00:24:10.517 --> 00:24:14.687
<i>♪ Back into my old ways again ♪</i>

00:24:19.058 --> 00:24:22.695
<i>♪ Back into
my old ways again... ♪</i>

00:24:23.462 --> 00:24:25.832
Shit. Come on.
This thing even work?

00:24:25.965 --> 00:24:29.101
Hmm. Maybe dad knows something
