00:24:30.136 --> 00:24:34.340
<i>♪ Thought I would never go back,
but just this once ♪</i>

00:24:34.440 --> 00:24:38.444
<i>♪ A little present
for holding out so long... ♪</i>

00:24:38.545 --> 00:24:39.879
Pennsylvania?

00:24:39.979 --> 00:24:42.348
Dad, what the fuck?

00:24:43.349 --> 00:24:44.517
<i>♪ Don't think I would... ♪</i>

00:24:44.617 --> 00:24:45.717
[line ringing]

00:24:45.718 --> 00:24:47.186
- [phone rings]
- You're up early.

00:24:47.319 --> 00:24:49.888
- It's moving day, right?
- Everything all right?

00:24:49.889 --> 00:24:52.057
Yeah, of course. Why?

00:24:52.058 --> 00:24:53.459
What are you doing
in Pennsylvania?

00:24:53.560 --> 00:24:55.193
Where-where are you going?

00:24:55.194 --> 00:24:57.864
[Dexter] <i>Aw, crap. This
location sharing was my idea.</i>

00:24:57.997 --> 00:25:00.533
- You remember Rapunzel?
<i>- Yeah.</i>

00:25:00.667 --> 00:25:02.101
There was a kill
matching his M.O.

00:25:02.201 --> 00:25:04.170
at a state park last night.

00:25:04.270 --> 00:25:06.072
He hasn't popped his head up
in a while.

00:25:06.172 --> 00:25:08.407
It's a good opportunity
for me to...

00:25:09.375 --> 00:25:12.244
...do what I do
before Rapunzel moves on

00:25:12.344 --> 00:25:15.047
and does what he does, again.

00:25:15.147 --> 00:25:16.916
You're in goddamn
Pennsylvania. Uh...

00:25:17.049 --> 00:25:18.885
That's-that's, like,
200 miles away.

00:25:18.985 --> 00:25:20.587
Have you been driving all night?

00:25:20.720 --> 00:25:21.887
I'll be back in plenty of time

00:25:21.888 --> 00:25:24.090
for your gun and shield
ceremony.

00:25:24.223 --> 00:25:25.557
Can't wait.

00:25:25.558 --> 00:25:27.759
Okay, yeah, s-so,
you-you've been up all night,

00:25:27.760 --> 00:25:30.396
and you're about to take on
a badass serial killer

00:25:30.496 --> 00:25:32.097
in the middle
of fucking nowhere.

00:25:32.098 --> 00:25:33.765
[Dexter]
<i>He sounds like Harry.</i>

00:25:33.766 --> 00:25:36.135
You sure this is a good idea?
I mean...

00:25:36.235 --> 00:25:39.105
aren't you out of your
comfort zone a little?

00:25:39.205 --> 00:25:41.407
It's not exactly my first rodeo.

00:25:41.507 --> 00:25:43.676
<i>Or even my hundredth rodeo.</i>

00:25:43.776 --> 00:25:46.778
Besides, Al is not a badass,
he's a tub of shit.

00:25:46.779 --> 00:25:48.748
You've got nothing
to worry about, buddy.

00:25:48.848 --> 00:25:50.917
It just feels like
you're taking on

00:25:51.017 --> 00:25:53.285
more risks than necessary.

00:25:53.385 --> 00:25:56.422
Especially for someone,
you know...

00:25:56.555 --> 00:25:58.591
[Dexter]
<i>Don't say it.</i>

00:25:58.691 --> 00:26:00.492
Uh, just, uh...

00:26:01.293 --> 00:26:03.095
...just be careful, Dad.

00:26:03.195 --> 00:26:06.298
I do, kind of
worry about you, sometimes.

00:26:06.398 --> 00:26:08.300
Yeah, well, you don't have to.

00:26:08.434 --> 00:26:10.102
I'll see you later.

00:26:10.202 --> 00:26:11.637
<i>All right?</i>

00:26:11.638 --> 00:26:12.872
Yeah.

00:26:12.972 --> 00:26:15.207
Yeah, I'll see you
at the ceremony.

00:26:16.042 --> 00:26:18.645
♪ suspenseful music ♪

